  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vulnerable Lives Matter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &apos;&apos;Vulnerable Lives Matter&apos;&apos; is a demand-driven and poverty alleviation initiative for the benefit of local communities in deprived regions of Belle Mare, Le Morne, Pointe aux Piments, Grand Bay ... through the following components:- Women employability and entrepreneurship- Youth employability - Supporting Youth  for their participation in Duke of Edinburg&apos;s International Programme- Supporting and empowering adults with disabilities</narrative>
  </description>
